# Spec Validation

- Every MATRIX row needs: format, dimensions (px or ratio), variant ID, brief ref.
- CANVA_OPS manifests must reference a valid BRIEFS/ file and MATRIX/ row.
- Run `python3 scripts/spec_validate.py` on changed paths before commit.
- Pillow optional: image checks skip gracefully if Pillow missing.
- Autofill fields: Enterprise-only — note in manifest, do not assume availability.
